OL,3,GNEWSAHow to make an 11th Century castle
OL,4,Afit for the future
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #2m conservation project to protect
OL,7,Fan 11th Century castle from the effects
OL,8,Fof weather and climate change has been
OL,9,Fcompleted.
OL,11,FWork to preserve Corfe Castle in Dorset
OL,12,Ffor future generations began three
OL,13,Fyears ago and has been described as "a
OL,14,Fmammoth task".
OL,16,FThe National Trust said the scheme was
OL,17,Fthe largest at the Dorset landmark
OL,18,Fsince the 1950s.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
