OL,3,GNEWSAHow to make an 11th Century castle
OL,4,Afit for the future
OL,5,
OL,6,FConservators repaired stonework,
OL,7,Fstabilised walls and investigated a
OL,8,Fpossible entrance linked to the
OL,9,Fcastle's betrayal during the English
OL,10,FCivil War.
